    ### Checklist
    
    #### Testing
    
    - [ ] **Boundary / edge-case coverage**: I reviewed whether this change
    involves boundary conditions (e.g. empty input, single/zero element,
    min/max values, off-by-one, sequence-length limits, integer overflow).
    Where applicable, I added unit tests covering these edge cases in
    `tests/ut/` or `tests/e2e/`.
    - [ ] **Regression test**: If this PR fixes a bug, I added a regression
    test that would fail without the fix.
    - [ ] **Error / failure path coverage**: I covered abnormal paths
    (exceptions, timeouts, out-of-range, division by zero) in addition to
    the happy path.
    - [ ] **Meaningful & reliable tests**: New tests assert real behavior
    and are not written merely to satisfy CI.
    - [ ] **Performance impact**: If this PR touches a performance-sensitive
    path, I attached benchmark results and added performance regression
    tests.
    
    
